WEBVTT

00:26:56.288 --> 00:27:00.954
you know, daring, greatly rising,
strong curriculum in the end.

00:27:00.954 --> 00:27:05.288
And the evaluation, what we
see over and over again,

00:27:05.788 --> 00:27:08.954
understanding the difference
between shame and guilt was

00:27:08.954 --> 00:27:10.579
the most important part of this work.

00:27:12.079 --> 00:27:16.871
Just understanding that there's a
difference between shame I am bad

00:27:16.871 --> 00:27:22.204
and guilt, I did something bad and
that how we talk to ourselves

00:27:22.204 --> 00:27:28.246
or how we use shame or guilt to parent or
lead has profoundly different outcomes.

00:27:28.246 --> 00:27:34.371
Right. Just understanding that I can look
at my child and say, you know what?